# Know One's Onions (windurst 40): the reply kinds of sections 1-3. Level 5, Windurst rank 2, fame 125; Truth, Justice,
# and the Onion Way! and Inspector's Gadget! completed by GM, so Onion Rings (windurst 42, a later container) is
# available and its offer (no Old Ring) answers Kohlo-Lakolo with 429 (Progress).
# - Section 1, this quest's char-var mustZone set by GM: its 379 (Event) loses to 429 (finished: Onion Rings Prog 1,
#   EndTime; it stays available and keeps offering 429). The mustZone cleared by GM, rank 3: 388 (Progress) ties with
#   429; the lookup plays the first container's, 388 (begun). An Event 388 would lose to 429. Made available again by
#   GM, rank 2: 391 ties with 429 and plays (begun, Prog 1).
# - Onion Rings accepted by GM at Prog 0 (no section of it: silent). Truth, Justice, and the Onion Way! made available,
#   then accepted, by GM (an earlier container, an Event line on every brigade member: 371, 373, 372, 374, 375, 377,
#   376). Section 2 (Prog 1): each Event line ties with the first quest's: the first quest's on one talk, this quest's
#   on the other (the lookup's cycle). A Progress line would play on both. Shanruru: the first quest's 377 only.
# - Section 3 (Prog 2 by GM): the same pairs, Kohlo-Lakolo's 399. The House of the Hero: The Puppet Master accepted by
#   GM (its 403, an Event); 288 (Progress) beats it (Prog 3); an Event 288 would tie with 403.
lists PortWindurst/Kohlo-Lakolo/onTrigger PortWindurst/Gomada-Vulmada/onTrigger PortWindurst/Papo-Hopo/onTrigger PortWindurst/Pichichi/onTrigger PortWindurst/Pyo_Nzon/onTrigger PortWindurst/Shanruru/onTrigger PortWindurst/Yafa_Yaa/onTrigger WindurstWalls/_6n2/onTrigger
